
POST http://localhost:3000/project?userEmail=admin@example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Project",
  "description": "A sample project",
  "duedate": "2025-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Get all projects for a user
GET http://localhost:3000/project?userEmail=admin@example.com

### Assign a user to a project
POST http://localhost:3000/project/assign?userEmail=admin@example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectTitle": "Test Project",
  "userId": "357c0841-763e-4e56-92bc-eb192020b52a"
}



##### Get all projects assigned to a user
GET http://localhost:3000/project/assigned?userId=user123

### Complete a project
POST http://localhost:3000/project/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user123"
}


### Path: project-management-backend/restclient/user.http
