Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "user123",
  "name": "Regular User"
}


### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Get a user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/users/357c0841-763e-4e56-92bc-eb192020b52a


